/* ── Hero: voice bars ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * A chart-like field borrowed from the sibling OCR story, shaped here by a
 * real Indic-Speak envelope. CSS owns the motion, so the hero needs no paint
 * loop while the reader scrolls.
 * ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
